sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as API Client
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (eu-ee31)
    participant Auth as AuthModule
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Route as Business Route

    Note over Client: Client has credentials in format:<br/>email:secret (Base64 encoded) OR uuid:secret (Base64 encoded)

    Client->>+Gate: GET /v1/identifiers/123ABC
    Note over Client,Gate: Authorization: Basic dXNlcjpzZWNyZXQ=<br/>(Base64 of "jaan.tamm@politsei.ee:generated-secret-uuid")

    Gate->>+Auth: authenticate(request)

    Auth->>Auth: Decode Base64 Authorization header
    Auth->>Auth: Split by ":" → email="jaan.tamm@politsei.ee", secret="generated-secret-uuid"

    Auth->>+DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'jaan.tamm@politsei.ee'
    DB-->>-Auth: User{id=d2e3f4a5, email=..., secretHash=sha256(...), roles={"AUTHORITY":["aut-politsei-001"]}, subsets=["EU07"]}

    Auth->>Auth: sha256(secret) == user.secretHash → valid

    Auth-->>-Gate: User{id=d2e3f4a5, roles={"AUTHORITY":["aut-politsei-001"]}, subsets=["EU07"]}

    Gate->>+Route: handle(exchange, user)
    Note over Route: @Access(AUTHORITY) annotation<br/>checks user.roles contains AUTHORITY

    Route->>Route: before(exchange)<br/>authorityId = user.roles["AUTHORITY"].first() = "aut-politsei-001"

    Route->>Route: Process identifier search
    Route-->>-Gate: result

    Gate-->>-Client: 200 OK (SSE stream)

    alt Invalid credentials
        Client->>Gate: Authorization: Basic aW52YWxpZDppbnZhbGlk
        Gate->>Auth: authenticate(request)
        Auth->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'invalid'
        DB-->>Auth: null
        Auth-->>Gate: null (authentication failed)
        Gate-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    alt Valid credentials but wrong role
        Client->>Gate: GET /v1/identifiers/123ABC (platform user, not authority)
        Gate->>Auth: authenticate
        Auth-->>Gate: User{roles={"PLATFORM":["demo"]}}
        Gate->>Route: @Access(AUTHORITY) check fails
        Gate-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end
